#: include/global_settings.php:1445
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Apkopes fona ģenerēšanas taimauts"

#: include/global_settings.php:1446
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Kadupul's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimālais laiks, ko var palaist Kadupul's Maintenance skripts, neradot taimauta kļūdu un nenogalinot."

